{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24201","headline":"奉和晋公侍中蒙除留守行及洛师感悦发中斐然成咏之作 · 白居易","name":"奉和晋公侍中蒙除留守行及洛师感悦发中斐然成咏之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸾凤翺翔在寥廓，貂蝉萧洒出埃尘。\n致成尧舜昇平代，收得夔龙强健身。\n抛掷功名还史册，分张欢乐与交亲。\n商山老皓虽休去，终是留侯门下人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}